'''Spirit''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the Spirit Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or from the Spirit & Soul Bundle for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2024|2024 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended. 

==Appearance==
Spirit is a knife with an ashy-like white blade with a desaturated black and grey handle. This knife's blade features sharp edges and curves which looks very similar to [[Ghostblade]] from the [[Halloween Event 2019|2019 Halloween Event]].

==Trivia==
*This knife partners with the [[Godly Weapons|Godly]] gun [[Soul]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Spirit Set|Spirit Set]].
*This and its partner gun are two of the eleven gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately with robux, the others being [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Flowerwood]], [[Flowerwood Gun]], [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

